<title>switzerland: TENNIS-SWISS TAKE WINNING 3-0 LEAD AGAINST MOROCCO IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWISS TAKE WINNING 3-0 LEAD AGAINST MOROCCO IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>OLTEN, Switzerland 1996-09-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland took an</p>
<p>unbeatable 3-0 lead against Morocco in their Davis Cup World</p>
<p>group qualifying tie after winning the doubles on Saturday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Jakob Hlasek/Marc Rosset beat Mehdi Tahiri/Mounir El Aarej 6-2</p>
<p>6-2 6-0</p>
</text>
